    "chunk_size_bytes": 1767,
    "chunk_text": "Lolitha Abeysinghe and Prasad Galhena join EML Consultants Board\n\nEML Consultants PLC has appointed Lolitha Abeysinghe and Prasad Galhena to its Board as Executive Directors.\n\nLolitha Abeysinghe is the Managing Director of Chelinaa Capital Corporation. He holds a Master\u2019s Degree in Business Administration and a Diploma in Marketing. He is also a Fellow Member of the Toronto Centre, Canada, in Securities Regulation. Abeysinghe is a former Commissioner of the Securities and Exchange Commission of Sri Lanka.\n\nGalhena is a distinguished strategic management professional, board-level leader, and transformation specialist with over two decades of experience guiding complex organisations across the public and private sectors. He is widely respected for his ability to provide strategic clarity, strengthen governance, and lead institutions through financial, regulatory, and operational reform.\n\nHis state-sector leadership includes serving as Chairman of nationally significant entities such as the Sri Lanka Sustainable Energy Authority, Ceylon Shipping Corporation, National Gem & Jewellery Authority, and the Sri Lanka Handicrafts Board (Laksala), as well as Board Director of the Ceylon Petroleum Corporation and Member of the Public Utilities Commission of Sri Lanka, where he played a key role in shaping policy, tariff structures, and regulatory frameworks of strategic importance to the national economy.\n\nIn the private and semi-Government sectors, he has held senior board and executive roles with organisations including HDFC Bank, NSBM Green University, SLT Visioncom, and Associated Newspapers of Ceylon Ltd (Lake House), demonstrating a rare ability to align public-sector discipline with private-sector performance and shareholder value creation."
