    "chunk_text": "Home Lands rewards high performers with brand-new vehicles\n\nHome Lands, Sri Lanka\u2019s number one and most trusted real estate developer, has always believed that its greatest strength lies in its people. The dedication, passion, and commitment of the Home Lands team are what drive the company forward, and this year too, the organisation celebrated those who consistently go above and beyond.\u00a0 Recently, at the luxurious Canterbury Golf City premises, Home Lands honored 25 high-performing employees with brand-new vehicles as a token of appreciation for their hard work and loyalty. The vehicles included BYD SEALION 6 luxury SUVs, high-end Toyota Cabs, and Toyota Raize SUVs, recognising each individual\u2019s exceptional contribution to the company\u2019s growth.\n\nHome Lands Group Chairman and Managing Director Nalin Herath said: \u201cOur team is our biggest asset. Every achievement at Home Lands is made possible because of our people. Recognising their dedication and rewarding their hard work is at the heart of our culture.\u201d\n\nAmong the recipients, the Top Sales Performer of 2025, Hiran Yatanwala was especially recognised for exceeding 100 units in sales and was awarded a BYD SEALION 6 luxury SUV for his remarkable achievement.\n\nFrom completed projects like Canterbury Golf City, Piliyandala - Kahathuduwa, to ongoing developments such as Pentara Residencies, the success of Home Lands has always been built on teamwork and collaboration. By celebrating the efforts of its employees, Home Lands not only rewards excellence but also inspires continued commitment, growth, and a shared vision for the future.\n\nAt Home Lands, every team member matters and every achievement is a reflection of the collective power of its people."
