    "chunk_size_bytes": 1932,
    "chunk_text": "Fairway Latitude launches with a vision of sustainable urban luxury\n\nWith a focus on liveable luxury and urban connectivity, Fairway Holdings this week launched its seventh apartment project, Latitude, bringing family-centric living to Colombo 05.\n\nFairway Holdings has established itself as a leading developer of luxury condominiums, with over 20 years of experience in the real estate market of Sri Lanka. Located at No. 7, High Level Road, Kirulapone, Latitude by Fairway represents the latest chapter in an expansive portfolio of contemporary home options from Fairway Holdings.\n\nThe luxury condominium project is strategically positioned in one of Colombo\u2019s most sought after residential areas, offering direct access to High-Level Road and Baseline Road. It places residents just\u00a0 minutes from leading schools, key business hubs, top hospitals, vibrant shopping destinations, and fine dining establishments.\n\nSpeaking at the launch, Fairway Holdings Chairman Virath de Alwis said that Fairway Latitude was a significant milestone for the company. Beyond their seventh luxury apartment project, it also marked Fairway\u2019s first residential venture established within Colombo\u2019s central business district. On the project\u2019s progress, he noted, \u201cConstruction of the project has already commenced, and we remain committed to delivering the same high Fairway standards that have defined our previous developments.\u201d\n\nLatitude is designed to combine practicality with luxury, offering residents a range of amenities aimed at comfort and convenience. These include a rooftop infinity pool with panoramic city views, a fully equipped gymnasium, a landscaped rooftop terrace, and a rooftop function hall that can host up to 250 guests. Additionally, for everyday needs, the development provides an on-site convenience store, concierge services, and an exclusive resident service app for the easy convenience of its homeowners."
  },
