    "chunk_text": "Latitude is designed to combine practicality with luxury, offering residents a range of amenities aimed at comfort and convenience. These include a rooftop infinity pool with panoramic city views, a fully equipped gymnasium, a landscaped rooftop terrace, and a rooftop function hall that can host up to 250 guests. Additionally, for everyday needs, the development provides an on-site convenience store, concierge services, and an exclusive resident service app for the easy convenience of its homeowners.\n\nFairway Latitude is also among the first high-rise residential projects in Sri Lanka to pursue formal green building certification. Each unit is equipped with engineered timber doors and floors, double-glazed uPVC windows, smart home provisions, energy-efficient systems, and LED lighting for homes, underscoring the project\u2019s commitment to sustainability and long-term liveability.\n\nFairway Properties Chief Growth Officer Rajitha Jayasuriya explained that Fairway Latitude was designed with families in mind. Beyond its prime location and luxury features, the apartments offer ample space, thoughtfully planned layouts, and except for two-bedroom units, all residences include practical features like maid\u2019s quarters and terraces to ensure privacy and comfort.\n\n\u201cTo complement your lifestyle, Fairway Latitude delivers everything it promises. A harmonious fusion of convenience and quality, sleek modernity, an excellent location, and ample space for the entire family. Fairway Latitude isn\u2019t just an address, it\u2019s your private retreat in the heart of Colombo,\u201d Jayasuriya explained."
