    "chunk_text": "\u201cTo complement your lifestyle, Fairway Latitude delivers everything it promises. A harmonious fusion of convenience and quality, sleek modernity, an excellent location, and ample space for the entire family. Fairway Latitude isn\u2019t just an address, it\u2019s your private retreat in the heart of Colombo,\u201d Jayasuriya explained.\n\nHe also explained that it positioned residents for a higher return on investment compared to other similar developments, making Latitude both a premier address and a sound financial opportunity.\n\nAt the launch, Fairway presented historical performance data from its previous six developments, including Fairway SkyGardens, Fairway Elements, and Fairway Urban Homes,\u00a0 which recorded price appreciations exceeding 100% over time.\n\nWith payment plans spread over 28 months, a reservation fee of SL Rs. 1.5 million, and launch-phase discounts available until the end of January 2026, Fairway positioned Latitude as a time-sensitive investment opportunity.\n\nWith more than 1,000 apartments completed across six projects and an industry presence of over 20 years, Fairway Holdings has reshaped skylines with properties including Fairway On The Waterfront, Fairmount Urban Oasis, Fairway SkyGardens, Fairway Galle, Fairway Elements, and Fairway Urban Homes. With its unique amenities and offerings, Fairway Latitude is uniquely positioned to continue the company\u2019s practice of uniting exceptional luxury with convenience and practical living."
