    "description": "Navigating new era of global taxation: Implications of OECD Pillar Two for Sri Lanka\u2019s FDI strategy",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Navigating-new-era-of-global-taxation-Implications-of-OECD-Pillar-Two-for-Sri-Lanka-s-FDI-strategy/4-787289",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
